; Misura prestazioni su hardware reale (senza log). Richiede Assign NGNFS:
FailAt 21
Set O NGNFS:build/real-perf-out.txt
Delete RAM:perf ALL QUIET >NIL:
MakeDir RAM:perf
Mount NGNFS:test/real/NFS0P >$O
Wait 2
List NAS:perf >NIL:
Echo "== lettura 5 MB" >>$O
Date >>$O
Copy NAS:perf/big5.bin RAM:perf/
Date >>$O
Echo "== scrittura 5 MB" >>$O
Date >>$O
Copy RAM:perf/big5.bin NAS:perf/up5.bin
Date >>$O
Echo "== lettura 100 file da 4 KB" >>$O
Date >>$O
Copy NAS:perf/small RAM:perf/small ALL QUIET
Date >>$O
Echo "== scrittura 100 file da 4 KB" >>$O
Date >>$O
Copy RAM:perf/small NAS:perf/up_small ALL QUIET
Date >>$O
Echo "== Delete 100 file" >>$O
Date >>$O
Delete NAS:perf/up_small ALL QUIET
Date >>$O
NGNFS:build/os3/NFSDismount NFS0: >>$O
Delete RAM:perf ALL QUIET >NIL:
Echo "== FINE" >>$O
